Package: soundcloud-cardputer
Version: 2.0.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Egor <egorkhlud9-cell@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pygame, python3-pil, python3-numpy, python3-evdev, mpv, yt-dlp
Description: Native SoundCloud player for Cardputer Zero
 Native 320x170 interface, public SoundCloud search and MPV playback with
 buffered network streams, local favorites, playlists and playback history.
 No API keys or subscription required.
